<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs off $0.25 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs off $0.25 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.25 lower. Trading was moderately active. Top $59.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-260 lbs   58.50-59.00</p>
<p>		  260-270 lbs   58.00-58.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3    270-280 lbs   57.00-58.00</p>
<p>		  280-290 lbs   56.00-57.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4    290-300 lbs   55.00-56.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $3.00. Top $54.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-450 lbs    scarce</p>
<p>		  450-500 lbs    47.00-48.00</p>
<p>		  500-650 lbs    49.00-51.00, few over 600 lbs to</p>
<p>54.00</p>
</text>
